<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>EMAIL</title>

  <style>
    .space{
      margin:25px;
    }
    .marginDocument {
      margin: 5px 25px;
    }

    .diva {
      background-color: #f1f1f1;
      padding-top: 20px;
      padding-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .divb {
      margin: 0px auto;
      max-width: 600px;
      background-color: white;
      border-radius: 5px;
    }

    .tableA {
      width: 100%;
      padding-top: 10px;
    }

    .divMain {
      width: 565px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center !important;
    }

    .divMain a {
      margin: 0 5px;
    }

    .label {
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 0px;
      color: rgba(0, 0, 0, .54);
    }

    .grey, .ii a[href] {
      color: #808080;
    }

    a:hover{
      color: #002469;
    }

    a:hover img{
      filter: invert(14%) sepia(58%) saturate(2574%) hue-rotate(207deg) brightness(91%) contrast(40%);
    }

    .styleCircle {
      text-decoration: none;
      width: 14.28%;
      border-right: 2px #fff solid;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 16px 0px;
      flex-direction: column;
      margin: 0 5px;
    }

    .faces>span {
      font-size: 30px;
    }

    .faceText {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .textCenter{
      text-align: center;
    }
    .cursive{
    	font-style: italic;
    }
    .firstLetters:first-letter {
    	text-transform: uppercase;
	}

  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="diva">
    <div class="divb">
      <table class="tableA">
        <tr>
          <td>
            <a href="$task.getUrl()" target="_blank" alt="AON SOLUTIONS" style="margin-left: 150px;">
              <img alt="icon" src="$task.getLogo()" style="cursor: pointer;" width="300px">
            </a>
          </td>
          <td></td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
          <td>
            <div class="space"></div>
          </td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
          <td>
            <div class="marginDocument">
              <b>Hola, <span class="firstLetters">$task.getTaskHolderName()</span> :</b><br>
             Te informamos que se ha $task.getTypeText() la solicitud en la Empresa <b>$task.getCompanyName()</b> con el siguiente número: <b>$task.getNumber()</b> y fecha $task.getDate().
            </div>
          </td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
          <td>
            <div class="marginDocument">
              <div class="cursive bold">
               <b>$task.getTitle()</b>
              </div>

              <div class="grey">
              	<br>
                $task.getDescription()
              </div>
                 
            </div>
          </td>
        </tr>
        #if( $task.getShowRating() )
	        <tr>
	          <td>
	            <hr>
	          </td>
	        </tr>
	        
	        <tr>
	          <td>
	            <span style="font-weight: 550;" class="marginDocument grey">¿ Cómo calificaría la atención recibida ?</span>
	          </td>
	        </tr>
	
	        <tr>
	          <td>
	            <div class="divMain" style="justify-content: center !important;">
	              <a href="$task.getUrl()/0" class="grey styleCircle" target="_blank">
	                <div class="faces">
	                  <img alt="Mala" src="https://aonsolutions.org/assets/img/sentiment_dissatisfied_black_36dp.png">
	                </div>
	                <div class="faceText">
	                  <span>Mala</span>
	                </div>
	              </a>
	
	              <a href="$task.getUrl()/1" class="grey styleCircle" target="_blank">
	                <div class="faces">
	                  <img alt="Regular" src="https://aonsolutions.org/assets/img/sentiment_neutral_black_36dp.png">
	                </div>
	                <div class="faceText">
	                  <span>Regular</span>
	                </div>
	              </a>
	
	              <a href="$task.getUrl()/2" class="grey styleCircle" target="_blank">
	                <div class="faces">
	                  <img alt="Buena" src="https://aonsolutions.org/assets/img/sentiment_satisfied_black_36dp.png">
	                </div>
	                <div class="faceText">
	                  <span>Buena</span>
	                </div>
	              </a>
	
	              <a href="$task.getUrl()/3" class="grey styleCircle" target="_blank">
	                <div class="faces">
	                  <img alt="Excelente" src="https://aonsolutions.org/assets/img/insert_emoticon_black_36dp.png">
	                </div>
	                <div class="faceText">
	                  <span>Muy buena</span>
	                </div>
	              </a>
	            </div>
	
	          </td>
	        </tr>
       #end
        <tr>
          <td>
            <hr>
          </td>
        </tr>

        <tr class="label">
          <td>
            <div style="text-align:center">Este es un mensaje generado autom&aacute;ticamente. Por favor, no conteste a
              este correo.</div>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>